    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμο-γέρων</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οντος</span>,
			ὁ, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a fresh, active old man,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.791
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Megasth.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Ind.</u>
				9.7
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.363.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.379
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>one untimely old,</i> as expl. of the 
				Ep.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμὸν γῆρας</span> (v. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠμός</span>”
