				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				821.48
			</span></i>: so as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βόστρυχος ὠ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.263
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Paul.Sil.
			</span></i>).</div>
